            <ArticleTitle>Intradural migration of broken IDET catheter causing a radiculopathy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>185-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This case report describes the migration of a broken intradiscal electrothermal therapy catheter tip from the disc space into the thecal sac, leading to a radiculopathy that improved after removing the catheter.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
